1. DEFINITIONS

1.1 "Deck" means the Anki deck package (.apkg), card templates, card text,
metadata, media, and all related files distributed from this repository or
its releases, including any updates.

1.2 "Content" means all text, questions, answers, explanations, formatting,
structure, ordering, tags, and expressive elements in the Deck or this
repository.

1.3 "Personal Use" means study by a single natural person for their own
non-commercial interview preparation or self-education. Personal Use does not
include use by or for any company, agency, bootcamp, school, training
provider, publisher, or other organization, even if no fee is charged.

1.4 "AI System" means any machine learning model, large language model,
embedding model, retrieval system, automated agent, classifier, recommender,
speech system, or other software that learns from, is trained on, fine-tuned
with, distilled from, evaluated on, or generates output based on data,
including synthetic or extracted data.

1.5 "Prohibited Use" includes any use not expressly allowed in Section 2.


2. LICENSE GRANT (PERSONAL USE ONLY)

Subject to your ongoing compliance with this Agreement, Tom Smykowski grants you a
