No other rights are granted. All rights not expressly granted are reserved.


3. PROHIBITED USES

You may NOT, and may NOT permit any third party to:

3.1 Commercial use. Use the Deck or Content for any commercial purpose,
including paid courses, coaching, hiring products, SaaS, consulting,
sponsorship, advertising, or any activity intended to generate revenue,
goodwill, or business advantage.

3.2 Redistribution. Copy, publish, share, upload, post, transmit, distribute,
sell, lend, rent, sublicense, or make the Deck or Content available to any
other person or platform, including file-sharing sites, mirrors, torrents,
cloud folders, email attachments, or "free deck" collections.

3.3 Derivative works. Modify, adapt, translate, abridge, expand, reorganize,
merge, or create derivative works from the Deck or Content, including new
decks, card sets, books, cheat sheets, blog posts, videos, slides, or study
